# Optional Gemini provider key for trusted local development only.
# Deployed environments run in production mode and the AI API routes are hard-disabled.
# Do not configure this secret in a public deployment until authentication, tenant
# isolation, shared quotas, abuse controls, and an independent security review exist.
GEMINI_API_KEY=""

# Optional: exact trusted reverse-proxy hop count for non-Vercel deployments.
# Leave unset unless the app is behind a known, controlled proxy chain.
# TRUST_PROXY_HOPS=1
